# Configuration

## Runtime

The generated CLI has no required environment variables. Secrets belong in
`.env`; only variable names go in `.env.example`.

## Local development

With the `python` or `node` stack:

```bash
scripts/dev.sh ping --json
bin/{{NPM_NAME}} --version
```

## Checks

`galadon.yaml` declares the real commands:

- build syntax-checks or compiles the source;
- test runs the test suite.

`galadon check` runs both and writes `verify/evidence.md`.

## Packaging

Distribution metadata is not generated. Read `docs/packaging.md` before adding a
manifest, and keep every version in sync with the changelog.
